  "description": "Durable transactional email for a Rask app, queued on its own database — no broker, no Redis. Compose an email (a Rask component rendered to HTML is the body), call `Mail.Send(email)`, and a background `MailProcessor` delivers it over SMTP (MailKit) — at-least-once, with exponential-backoff retries and dead-lettering, as the tenant it was queued for. Zero-config in development: logs or writes `.eml` files when no SMTP server is set. Server-side; pairs with EF Core.",
